    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "Group vote shares by Ward, Party, and Election Year\n",
        "\n",
        "Pivot table to create explicit historical lag columns (2011, 2016, 2021)\n",
        "\n",
        "Rename columns to clear Machine Learning feature names\n",
        "\n",
        "Impute 0.0 for parties that did not contest in prior cycles\n",
        "\n",
        "Calculate historical party momentum/growth rate feature"
      ],
      "metadata": {
        "id": "Ve3VvaVYA9nW"
